From: Codex local compatibility adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] Adapt GlobalPostProcMgr encoder register for A376B

Reason: attempt12 reports at `unica/patches/legacy/customize.sh:719` that the expected `const v3, 0x7f420888` is absent in GlobalPostProcMgr. The actual decoded AZH4 EncoderFilter.configCodec contains `const v4, 0x7f420888` at line 1908 and uses v4 for the value subsequently passed to Message.get. Change that exact donor operand to the same target-compatible color format used by the existing encoder patches.
Files: unica/patches/legacy/customize.sh.
Verification: inspect exact AZH4 method/constant, donor-only v4 patch and compiled APK rebuild; leave v3 upstream path unchanged for other donors.

---
--- a/unica/patches/legacy/customize.sh
+++ b/unica/patches/legacy/customize.sh
@@ -716,11 +716,19 @@
             fi
         fi
         if [ -f "$WORK_DIR/system/system/priv-app/GlobalPostProcMgr/GlobalPostProcMgr.apk" ]; then
-            SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/priv-app/GlobalPostProcMgr/GlobalPostProcMgr.apk" \
-                "smali/com/samsung/android/sum/core/filter/EncoderFilter.smali" "replace" \
-                'configCodec(Lcom/samsung/android/sum/core/message/Message;)V' \
-                'const v3, 0x7f420888' \
-                'const v3, 0x7f000789'
+            if [ "${ROM_SOURCE_CONFIG:-}" = "essi_a376b_android16" ]; then
+                SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/priv-app/GlobalPostProcMgr/GlobalPostProcMgr.apk" \
+                    "smali/com/samsung/android/sum/core/filter/EncoderFilter.smali" "replace" \
+                    'configCodec(Lcom/samsung/android/sum/core/message/Message;)V' \
+                    'const v4, 0x7f420888' \
+                    'const v4, 0x7f000789'
+            else
+                SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/priv-app/GlobalPostProcMgr/GlobalPostProcMgr.apk" \
+                    "smali/com/samsung/android/sum/core/filter/EncoderFilter.smali" "replace" \
+                    'configCodec(Lcom/samsung/android/sum/core/message/Message;)V' \
+                    'const v3, 0x7f420888' \
+                    'const v3, 0x7f000789'
+            fi
         fi
         SMALI_PATCH "system" "system/priv-app/SamsungCamera/SamsungCamera.apk" \
             "smali_classes3/com/samsung/android/sum/core/filter/EncoderFilter.smali" "replace" \
